 "consensus": {
  "consensus": "The company and the $140M pre-money assume 8 panels per analyzer-day, a Q1 2027 clearance, a 2027 CLIA waiver, $78.5M of 2029 revenue and a point-of-care market of $2.4B; the insider $8M commitment implies existing investors accept that timeline.",
  "our_view": "The need is real and the packaging lead is genuine for 12-24 months, but the plan is priced as if clearance, waiver and 8-panel utilisation all land on schedule. We would invest only at $60-80M pre-money, with the Series A participation capped, the $30M tranched on clearance and the Corvia terms cleaned up; at $140M the evidence supports waiting.",
