   "evidence": "The 41-site evaluation base reordered at 92% and the 52-clinic survey reports a median 14 send-outs a day, so latent demand exists [S1]; Abbott's own point-of-care line sold $606M in FY2025, showing the channel pays [S67]; a waived five-analyte panel would be first-of-kind [S72, S104].",
